  "instructions": [
    "Heat peanut oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add shiitake mushrooms and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Crush fermented kimchi into small pieces and add to the wok with garlic.",
    "Slice green peppers thinly. Add them to the wok followed by the vinegar, soy sauce, sugar, and salt.",
    "Stir-fry all ingredients for another 2-3 minutes until combined and slightly reduced in volume.",
    "Serve hot as a side dish or main course."
